    "date": "2001-08-26"
  },
  "description": {
    "text": "The Italian cards of the half deck handed to the players of the 2001 Tropical Mega Battle in Hawaii, on 25 and 26 August 2001. Twenty-three players from ten countries took part, one of them from Italy, and the deck was printed in the players' languages for the second day of play. Media Factory printed it in the layout of the Japanese VS expansion, which was never released in Italian, so these are the only Italian VS cards.\n\nSeventeen Italian cards are recorded: twelve Owner's Pokémon such as Karen's Rapidash and Janine's Beedrill, and the Trainers Tropical Breeze, Energy Ark, Super Scoop Up, Switch and Potion. Only five have a known picture. The deck was given out again in 2002 with Clair's Mantine corrected, but no picture of either Italian print has been found."
  },
